From 835054578d9902db4f5968b61a923bbf61a55a76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gezim <25499045+gezimos@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 08:58:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Kompakt: the library is the home screen

Albums, Artists, Genres and Playlists are the bottom tabs; search sits in the header beside settings; the provider and the Activity page open from Settings.

The pager, the tab and the title show the page this fragment keeps; the pager neither saves nor restores its own page. PagedScroll leaves a ViewPager2's own RecyclerView alone: replacing its layout manager reset the pager to page 0 under the remembered tab on every return. A new page is held until it is built (MainActivity.holdPageUntilReady), and the mini player changes in the same step.

Navigation has no page animations: a zero length one still kept the outgoing page drawn under the new one. The playing track on an album page is not activated: activated is the ink on a filled row, and that row has no fill.

Change-Id: Ibe1c0fcfb4ba9e35c896ea83777492e0a8b2e8d5
